<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LCI Int'l raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LCI Int'l raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has raised its rating for LCI International Inc to buy from hold, a source at the brokerage said Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the McLean, Va., communications services company closed Monday at 18-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
